Peerstack Exam System — Authors
===============================

This file lists every person who holds an authorship interest in this work.

Sole author, architect and copyright holder
-------------------------------------------

    Damir Pashayev  <pashayevdamir@gmail.com>
    https://github.com/pasayevdemir

    Author of the complete work: application architecture, domain model,
    exam engine, anti-cheat layer, scoring engine, import pipeline,
    mathematics rendering, user interface, test suite, container topology
    and deployment automation.

    Every commit in this repository's version control history is authored
    by, and attributable to, the person named above.

Other contributors
------------------

    None.

    No other person or organisation has contributed source code to this work.
    Should a contribution be accepted in future, it will be recorded here
    together with the scope of the contribution; the absence of any other name
    from this file is itself a statement of fact about the origin of this work.

Third-party components
----------------------

This work builds upon independently licensed open-source components, which
remain the property of their respective authors and are used under their own
licence terms. These components are declared in `composer.json` and
`package.json` and are installed into `vendor/` and `node_modules/`; they are
not part of the copyrighted work described above, and nothing in this file
asserts any claim over them.

Notable third-party components: Laravel Framework, Bootstrap, KaTeX,
league/commonmark, phpoffice/phpspreadsheet, FontAwesome, Axios, Vite.

